# Blossom docs & theme parity

## Repos

| Repo | Path | Role |
|------|------|------|
| Macro | `Blossom/` (this repo) | App UI, themes, changelog source |
| Docs | `../blossom.github.io/` | Public site at [blossom.github.io](https://blossom.github.io) |

When you change **user-visible** macro behavior or visuals, update **both** repos in the same work session when applicable.

## Docs content sync

- **`assets/noticetabcontents.txt`** is the in-app changelog / Notice tab source of truth (see `changelog.mdc`).
- Docs pages should describe the same features, tabs, and workflows users see in the app (Macro, Calibrations, Webhooks, Appearance, etc.).
- Adding or renaming a UI tab, mode, or major setting → update the matching page under `blossom.github.io/` (and nav if needed).
- Tone: plain, human, user-facing — not internal jargon or dev-channel wording.

## Theme token sync

Canonical palette lives in:

1. **`src/blossom_custom_ui.py`** — §1 design tokens (default midnight / pink-dark)
2. **`assets/blossom-themes.css`** — built-in theme variants (pink, dark, sakura, midnight navy, …)
3. **`assets/blossom-revamp.css`** — **shape layer that wins in shipped UI**: `--r-sm/md/lg/xl` (8/12/16/20px), sidebar 212px, card padding 13×14px, revamp shadows/gradients

Default shipped theme is **`midnight`** (pink-dark palette in `index.html`, not navy midnight).

**When editing macro theme CSS**, also update **`blossom.github.io/assets/css/site.css`**:

| Token group | Macro source | Docs mirror |
|-------------|--------------|-------------|
| `--bg-root`, `--bg-sidebar`, `--bg-main`, `--bg-card`, inputs | `blossom_custom_ui.py` §1 or `blossom-themes.css` | `:root` in `site.css` |
| `--accent`, `--accent-dim`, `--accent-text`, borders, text | same | same |
| Radii | `blossom-revamp.css` `--r-*` (not theme `0px` zeros) | `--r-sm` … `--r-xl` + `--radius-*` aliases |
| Depth | revamp `--blsm-accent-soft/faint`, card gradient + shadow | same helpers in `site.css` |
| Sidebar width | 212px (`blossom-revamp.css`) | `--sidebar-w: 212px` |
| Fonts | App: `Sarpanch, Inter, …` (macro UI) | Docs: `--font-display`, `--font-body` = Google Sans Flex; `--font-mono` = JetBrainsMono Nerd Font |

Revamp rounded corners replace legacy zero-radius corner brackets unless a page explicitly uses `.cornered`.

## Theme parity checklist

Before finishing theme work:

- [ ] `:root` tokens in `site.css` match macro midnight (or chosen default) hex values
- [ ] Revamp radii (8/12/16/20) applied to cards, nav, buttons, callouts
- [ ] Sidebar 212px; brand/nav/footer padding matches revamp
- [ ] Card/surface gradients and hover lift match revamp pattern
- [ ] No secrets, license keys, webhook URLs, or private infra in docs

## Security

Never commit API keys, Discord bot tokens, license-server URLs with credentials, or user HWIDs to the docs repo.
